        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each level\u2019s grid to step onto every goal cell while your carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal\u2019s required values; completing all goals advances levels, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina hits 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is blocked by walls and the state provides a list of blocked_directions that must never be chosen. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135 (wrap), color modifiers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange (wrap), and rotation modifiers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise 0\u00b0\u219290\u00b0\u2192180\u00b0\u2192270\u00b0\u21920\u00b0 (wrap). A goal only activates when shape, color, and rotation all match simultaneously, and stepping onto an activated goal completes it; stamina refill tiles restore stamina."
